The social data model (profiles, endorsements, work history, connection requests,
posts, groups) follows ShlinkedIn, https://github.com/cbh123/shlinked, which is
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3. Wesyn ports the
shape of that model to TypeScript; it does not copy ShlinkedIn's Elixir source,
its satire content or its joke mechanics. See docs/shlinked-intake.md.

The world OSINT panel shows rows from the ShadowBroker board
(https://github.com/wizzense/Shadowbroker, AGPL-3.0) through Aitherium's public read
API; each row keeps its own source link.

The optional in-tab copilot loads Aitherium's Bonsai runtime from aitherium.com at run
time. That runtime is separately licensed and is not part of this repository or this
licence; see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md ("The copilot").

